node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.local

# Yarn (Zero-Install disabled: the release binary IS committed, caches are not)
.yarn/*
!.yarn/releases
.pnp.*

# Video source material. The clips are copyrighted and kept for personal
# practice, so none of them are committed. This is an allowlist rather than a
# list of extensions to exclude: default-deny means a format nobody thought of
# is out too.
#
# The photographed book pages under packages/stick-control/sources/ are the
# deliberate exception — they ARE committed, so an exercise can be put beside
# its page from a clone alone. No rule here mentions them, so that nothing
# claims otherwise: a pattern saying "ignored" over files git actually tracks
# is how the previous arrangement misled for three weeks.

packages/videos/sources/**
!packages/videos/sources/**/
!packages/videos/sources/**/grid.json
!packages/videos/sources/**/*.md

!CLAUDE.md